    "https://www.ohiodominican.edu/admissions/undergraduate/deposit.html": {
      "title": "Submit Deposit",
      "description": "Submit Deposit Ohio Dominican University Menu Close Menu Request Info Visit Apply Give Alumni Quicklinks PantherLearn ODU Online ODU Self-Service TK20 Navigate360 Email Webfile Room Reservations Helpdesk Campus Events Faculty & Staff Resources Search the Site Search Ohio Dominican University About Mission, Identity & History Fast Facts University Leadership Accreditation & Assessment Consumer Information ODU News Faculty & Staff Directory Office Directory Campus Map Career Opportunities Admissions Undergraduate Admission Graduate Admission Online Degrees & Programs International Admission Transfer to ODU Military & Veteran Students Tuition & Aid Visit Campus Submit Your Deposit Apply Now Academics Majors & Programs Honors Program International Education & Study Abroad Center for Dominican Studies Academic Calendar Registrar Academic Catalog ODU Library Services Academic Advising & Student Success Tutoring Services (ARC) Student Life Student Life Residence Life Campus Ministries Clubs & Organizations Athletics The Arts @ ODU Dining Services Campus Events Life in Columbus Campus Resources Financial Aid Career Development Center Health Services Wellness Center Accessibility Services Business Office Campus Safety & Parking IT Helpdesk Slingshot Bookstore Conference & Event Hosting Submit Deposit Home Admissions Undergraduate Admission Submit Deposit Secure Your Spot! Congratulations and Welcome to ODU — pay your undergraduate enrollment deposit today\n                              to officially join our incoming class! Enrollment Deposit Paying your $150 undergraduate enrollment deposit to Ohio Dominican University couldn't be easier. Deposit now so that you can register\n                           for Orientation, secure your place in our next class and start planning your life\n                           as a Panther! Housing Deposit Students intending to live on campus must submit a $150 housing deposit* . You can pay your housing deposit online using the enrollment deposit form. On-campus\n                           housing selections are made in order of when your deposit is received, so don't delay!\n                           #LiveAtODU PAY YOUR DEPOSIT International and Graduate students, click here. *Note: you do not have to submit your housing deposit when you commit to ODU. If you\n                        have questions about your housing deposit, email reslife@ohiodominican.edu . Other Ways to Pay Send check or money order, payable to Ohio Dominican University: Office of Undergraduate Admission Ohio Dominican University 1216 Sunbury Road Columbus, Ohio  43219 International Students For all international students, whether seeking your bachelor's or master's degree,\n                           please submit your deposit at the link below. International Student Deposit Questions? Email international@ohiodominican.edu . Graduate Students For students admitted through our Graduate Admission office for one of our Master's\n                           degree programs, please see the links below. Graduate Programs Deposit International Student Deposit M.S. in Anesthesiologist Studies Deposit M.S. in Physician Assistant Studies Deposit Questions? Email grad@ohiodominican.edu . Submit Deposit Undergraduate Admission Home Admission FAQ & Process Request Info Visit & Events Find Your Counselor Tuition & Fees Pay Your Deposit New Student Orientation School Counselor Resources Panther Promise Program Catholic Promise Program Student Ambassadors Contact Admission Office Facebook LinkedIn YouTube Instagram 1216 Sunbury Road Columbus, Ohio 43219 614-251-4500 Apply Visit Give Athletics Alumni Parents & Families Directory Campus Map Safety & Parking Business Office Calendar Careers at ODU © Privacy Policy Title IX Policy Compliance Reporting Website Assistance Social Media Ohio Dominican University, in fostering our Catholic and Dominican identity, respects\n                              and honors the dignity of each person regardless of age, race, ethnicity, religion,\n                              socioeconomic status, sexual orientation, gender identity, country of origin, disability,\n                              and other expressions of human individuality. Therefore, Ohio Dominican University\n                              is committed to ensuring an inclusive environment that welcomes all who seek to find\n                              and share the truth, trusting in the rigor of reason and the light of faith to unite\n                              our diverse community. © Ohio Dominican University. All Rights Reserved."
    },
    "https://www.ohiodominican.edu/campus-resources/career-development/index.html": {
      "title": "Career Development Center",
      "description": "ODU's Career Development Center Ohio Dominican University Menu Close Menu Request Info Visit Apply Give Alumni Quicklinks PantherLearn ODU Online ODU Self-Service TK20 Navigate360 Email Webfile Room Reservations Helpdesk Campus Events Faculty & Staff Resources Search the Site Search Ohio Dominican University About Mission, Identity & History Fast Facts University Leadership Accreditation & Assessment Consumer Information ODU News Faculty & Staff Directory Office Directory Campus Map Career Opportunities Admissions Undergraduate Admission Graduate Admission Online Degrees & Programs International Admission Transfer to ODU Military & Veteran Students Tuition & Aid Visit Campus Submit Your Deposit Apply Now Academics Majors & Programs Honors Program International Education & Study Abroad Center for Dominican Studies Academic Calendar Registrar Academic Catalog ODU Library Services Academic Advising & Student Success Tutoring Services (ARC) Student Life Student Life Residence Life Campus Ministries Clubs & Organizations Athletics The Arts @ ODU Dining Services Campus Events Life in Columbus Campus Resources Financial Aid Career Development Center Health Services Wellness Center Accessibility Services Business Office Campus Safety & Parking IT Helpdesk Slingshot Bookstore Conference & Event Hosting Career Development Center Home Campus Resources Career Development Center Your Path to Career Success Our goal is simple — to help you  begin  your career journey  while on campus and to  prepare for a successful career after graduation. Whether you have yet to decide\n                              on a major, are drafting your resume and cover letters, or are looking for an internship\n                              or job, our experienced and dedicated team will make sure you have access to ODU’s\n                              vast collection of resources and network of corporate partners to help you stand out\n                              in a competitive job market. About Us & Services Learn about the Career Development Center staff, resources, support services, program\n                           and events. Learn More For Students & Alumni Access free resources, including career coaching, Focus 2 Assessment, events and more. Learn More For Employers Connecting current students, alumni and recruiters through job postings and career\n                           events. Learn More Contact us today! Erskine Hall, Suite 108 careercenter@ohiodominican.edu Make a Career Advising Appointment We can help you with: Columbus - A hot bed for professional growth and opportunities Capitalize on the Capital City. Going to college in the nation’s 15th-largest city means you get to learn first-hand\n                     why USA Today recently ranked Columbus as a Top 5 City to Start a Career. Columbus is home to: Five Fortune 500 16 Fortune 1000 companies 450 internationally owned companies We make it a priority to create relationships with businesses in the area – both small\n                                 and large! Career Development Center Information & Services For Students and Alumni For Employers & Recruiters Experiential Learning Process at ODU Facebook LinkedIn YouTube Instagram 1216 Sunbury Road Columbus, Ohio 43219 614-251-4500 Apply Visit Give Athletics Alumni Parents & Families Directory Campus Map Safety & Parking Business Office Calendar Careers at ODU © Privacy Policy Title IX Policy Compliance Reporting Website Assistance Social Media Ohio Dominican University, in fostering our Catholic and Dominican identity, respects\n                              and honors the dignity of each person regardless of age, race, ethnicity, religion,\n                              socioeconomic status, sexual orientation, gender identity, country of origin, disability,\n                              and other expressions of human individuality. Therefore, Ohio Dominican University\n                              is committed to ensuring an inclusive environment that welcomes all who seek to find\n                              and share the truth, trusting in the rigor of reason and the light of faith to unite\n                              our diverse community. © Ohio Dominican University. All Rights Reserved."
    },
    "https://ohiodominican.applicantpro.com/pages/jobtype/": {
      "title": "Job Type",
      "description": "Job Type - Ohio Dominican University Job Type Home Jobs Login What makes Ohio Dominican such a special place to work? It's our people! Whether you're faculty or staff, we're committed to providing you with a professional, engaging, supportive and fun work environment. Please click on the buttons below to view available positions in each category: Ohio Dominican University is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees, as we respect and seek to empower each individual and support the various cultures, perspectives, skills and experiences within our workforce. Hiring Software Maintained by isolved Talent Acquisition - © 2026 Refresh"
